  "question": {
    "text": "A long straight wire of radius a carries a steady current 1 . The current is uniformly distributed across its cross section. The ratio of the magnetic field at $\\frac{\\mathrm{a}}{2}$ and 2a from axis of the wire is:",
    "image": null
  },
