  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Magnetic field due to straight wire,\n$B=\\frac{\\mu_0 I}{2 \\pi r}$\nMagnetic field at $\\frac{a}{2}$ is,\n$\\mathrm{B}_{\\mathrm{a} / 2}=\\frac{\\mu_0 \\mathrm{I}}{2 \\pi(\\mathrm{a} / 2)}$\n$\\therefore \\frac{\\mathrm{B}_{\\mathrm{a} / 2}}{\\mathrm{~B}_{2 \\mathrm{a}}}=\\frac{1}{1}=1: 1$",
    "image": null
